  "title": "PlatformSurfaceEventMap",
  "description": "Events the input pipeline sources from the drawing surface itself. The payload types are the browser's event shapes, narrowed to the fields the engine reads. Keeping the vocabulary this close to the DOM is deliberate: BrowserPlatform forwards the browser's own event objects verbatim, so the main-thread path pays nothing for the abstraction, while a host without a DOM can deliver the same information as an ordinary object.",
